inherit_err.wf:1:18: error[W0036]: inherit paths are not quoted
  |
1 | inherit combat = "/std/mixins/combat"
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: write `inherit /std/room`
inherit_err.wf:2:11: error[W0037]: expected a path segment after `/`
  |
2 | inherit / std/item
  |           ^^^
  = help: paths look like `/std/room` (no spaces, no extension)
inherit_err.wf:3:18: error[W0038]: inherit paths have no file extension
  |
3 | inherit /std/item.wf
  |                  ^
  = help: drop the `.wf`
inherit_err.wf:4:9: error[W0030]: expected a program path like `/std/room`, found integer `3`
  |
4 | inherit 3 = /std/x
  |         ^
inherit_err.wf:7:13: error[W0074]: `combat::roll` must be called
  |
7 |     combat::roll
  |             ^^^^
  = help: `::` calls an inherited function, e.g. `combat::roll()`; enum variants are written `Kind.A` or `.A`
inherit_err.wf:8:5: error[W0063]: `inherit` is only allowed at the top level of a file
  |
8 |     inherit /std/late
  |     ^^^^^^^
  = help: move it to the top of the file
inherit_err.wf:11:1: error[W0035]: `inherit` must come before any declarations
   |
11 | inherit /std/too_late
   | ^^^^^^^
   = help: move it to the top of the file
